   "hikalziyad": "Al-Mizzī: the soundest of people in al-Awzāʿī («wa-huwa athbat al-nās fīhi»). Symbols: م ٤.",
   "firyabi": "Symbols: ع.",
   "ebulmugirehavlani": "Symbols: ع.",
   "asimbehdele": "One of the seven imāms of Qurʾānic recitation.",
